GAL22V10
TEST22V

Clock A   B   C   D   E   F   G    H   NC  NC GND
NC    AND NAN OR  NOR XOR MUX INV  Q0  Q1  MAJ VCC

AND   = A * B
/NAN  = A * B
OR    = A + B
/NOR  = A + B
XOR   = A * /B + /A * B
MUX   = E * /G + F * G
INV   = /H
MAJ   = A * B + A * C + B * C
Q0.R  = /Q0
Q1.R  = Q1 * /Q0 + /Q1 * Q0
AR    = D
SP    = GND

DESCRIPTION
TOP2049 / toprammer GAL22V10 test design.
Pin 14 AND = A*B, 15 NAND, 16 OR = A+B, 17 NOR, 18 XOR = A^B,
19 MUX = G ? F : E, 20 INV = /H, 23 MAJ = majority(A,B,C).
Pins 21/22 (Q0/Q1) form a 2-bit counter clocked on pin 1;
D (pin 5) high = asynchronous reset of the counter.
